Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.32,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone,\Nwe'll go where we all wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can grab Kaido's clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.84,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're both dragons, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I can't push it back,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I can stop its advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or even better, I can\Nchange its direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.16,0:02:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.26,0:02:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The capital will not be\Ndestroyed under my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As its rightful Shogun, I will guide\Nthe land of Wano to a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He shot beams from his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we need to find a new spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.20,0:03:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us retreat further back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi-chi's gone! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I lose him in the explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to search.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know when another might hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.98,0:03:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to leave him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.76,0:03:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you know this one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Henry Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that Niji's move?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're catching onvin smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you clever?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.76,0:04:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.36,0:04:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen don't give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did I ace the test or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can tell, I did thorough\Nresearch on all of Jamba's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can replicate any move that your\Nbrothers do, except not make it look good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I cut ties with those jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea was to show it to\Nyou after you transformed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:05:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but you really screwed that up for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.58,0:05:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Kicking your ass is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't really stick it to\NJudge unless I beat you in the suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd prove my superiority\Nbeyond a shadow of a doubt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a crap about\Nyour dumb rivalries!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm starting to\Nthink that you don't like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I nailed it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You've probably been on the\Nreceiving end of that one before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.28,0:05:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My beautiful arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, punk, it's on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.56,0:06:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep talking about those bastards\Nand this is what you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.92,0:06:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You telling me I gotta watch what\NI say cause you're too sensitive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me make one thing clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit or no suit you're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got everything I need right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.22,0:06:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's save.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think\Nyou have the upper hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent your ass flying once\Nalready and I can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't enough to win,\Nbut I know that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been fighting for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be wearing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.64,0:07:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.58,0:07:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, I've\Nalready accepted my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the same guy you fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.20,0:07:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Inferno Weakley!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.94,0:07:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't never had a foe like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not going to use it, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealth blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can do it all, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.24,0:07:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your back is wide open, smoke sloppily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did he disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't have to suit anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be moving so fast\Nhe's become invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll run out of stamina soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.36,0:08:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll have to show himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.94,0:08:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think this one through, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of here, rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoujou!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.36,0:08:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.48,0:08:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry to a safe spot\Nbefore those two start fighting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.92,0:08:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome-y!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That trap is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.94,0:08:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where did you run off to, Thinsmoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.84,0:08:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I have nothing to do with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a geisha from the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.96,0:08:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome man!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be in bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I came by asking for your services,\Nand they said you had a headache!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.28,0:09:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you look nice and healthy\Nto me, you filthy little liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I try to be a good customer to\Nyou, and this is what I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.62,0:09:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejection and deception?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting too\Ncocky for your own good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to be my number\None girl now that Komurasaki is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for lying to me and for\Nall those times you turned me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is divine punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.32,0:09:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your behavior required\Nswift and punitive action.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural.\NJustice has been served.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not showing an ounce of remorse looks\Nlike I need to punish you a second time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.66,0:10:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what you've\Ngained an exoskeleton muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,strength and mobility more\Ntools in my arsenal that's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.74,0:10:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,all if i fine-tune my\Narmament Haki and cover my
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.04,0:10:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,exoskeleton with it my legs\Nwill become stronger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.50,0:10:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be capable of supporting\Neven hotter flames than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Fire Chamba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.10,0:10:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster acceleration, heavier weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.58,0:10:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any more doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that a man\Nshould never hit a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's been a fact since\Nthe age of dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known, scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:10:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.26,0:11:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Call Yang Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Master Tweet\Ncome from? Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave him to me. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.72,0:11:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Venge Smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Alarun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.98,0:11:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shumar Miftas!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tendron! Blanche!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,K! Warre! Jares!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.88,0:12:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that has been smoke\Npower five ever three years!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're still trying to\Ndeny the truth, Jeremiah boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one in denial.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm my own man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.40,0:12:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeating that crap doesn't make it true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This dish still needs its final touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinosaur meat's tough, but\Nthere's nothing I can't cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a failed cyborg and a failed human!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.84,0:12:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose to a\Nsecond-rate science project!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.38,0:12:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get lost, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.02,0:13:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.28,0:13:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little friend is safe. Jaggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.74,0:13:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji was making some\Nof that rat food again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.34,0:13:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And you take good care of her too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not still pleading, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.16,0:14:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone bring a first aid, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember, our mother selflessly gave\Nher life to protect you and your humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're kinder\Nand more tender than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle in the pleasure hall of\Nthe skull dome has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner is Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Something happens when the\Nflames on his back go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He speeds up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:15:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But his defense, on the\Nother hand, gets weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He destroyed Master King's mask. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like the\Nrumors about him are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.48,0:15:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Black wings, white hair, brown skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If we tipped off the government, we'd\Nget a hundred million bear rebounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hypothetically, that is\NImperial Flaming Wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle's already burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep your cool and set an\Nexample for your men, not set them on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not step outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem a little tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That hundred million berry\Nthing really got to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.52,0:15:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell of a bounty for intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What tribe are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:15:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bother asking when\Nyou're about to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.18,0:16:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever his tribe is, it must be rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But this goes on much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword will kill me before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.80,0:16:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You are far more\Ndangerous than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign has gone on for long\Nenough, as tyrants end as pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:16:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather arrogant, Arsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kaido's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He will become the king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but that dream ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.30,0:17:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,King of Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.68,0:17:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Pugatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I see why the world\Ngovernment won't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Lunarian, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.48,0:18:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your durability\Ntest earlier. Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out of this dump, and then\NI'm going to start a new pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do, guinea pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.52,0:18:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn this boring world upside\Ndown if you want to come that's your choice
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Change the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.38,0:18:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.48,0:19:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The test subjects are\Nescaping the facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them at any cost! Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.90,0:19:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking this shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.32,0:19:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they sure aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.20,0:19:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullets don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.38,0:19:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.44,0:19:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.90,0:19:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Albear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Albear, you're very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,From here on out, I'll call you King.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You watch my back, and I'll watch yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never sell you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my right-hand man to the end, King.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This world only has proof for one ruler!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The flames are burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, Ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Flaming Wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that? Magma?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a damned weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.18,0:21:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These swords are treasures!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sped up. This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.50,0:21:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can cut him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Burnt it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.94,0:22:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,See, you figured out my trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.02,0:22:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very clever of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.44,0:22:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're damn right I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now nothing can stop me from beating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.42,0:22:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultra!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.00,0:22:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.96,0:23:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to block me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.90,0:23:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you scared what\Nmight attack my duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.80,0:23:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You are biologically\Nincapable of defeating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaming biologists is a weak excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.34,0:24:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't limit myself like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.04,0:24:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall remember you for your brave\Nresorts, or your arrogance, I should say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.40,0:24:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll carve it into your memory myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.00,0:24:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I seriously doubt\Nyou'll live through this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.44,0:24:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Bellamy Frames!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.22,0:25:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.38,0:25:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,King of Hell, Three-Sword Serpents!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.66,0:25:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred and three mercies!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.04,0:25:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end for you, Rorodawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon damnation!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.30,0:26:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.78,0:26:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.70,0:26:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You still holding on to that, Dream King?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.04,0:26:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think I'm Joy Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.28,0:26:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm not complaining here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.02,0:26:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you sure the world I'm looking\Nto make is the one that you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.52,0:26:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, a legend is just a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And I could never ask for\Nmore than you've given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.56,0:26:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alive because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.86,0:26:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My life is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.98,0:26:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must remain undefeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.90,0:26:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.28,0:26:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.34,0:27:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you need nothing less than\Nthe greatest swordsman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.80,0:27:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So until the day comes\Nwhen I defeat him and take
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,his title I promise you\Nthat I will never lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.68,0:27:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Again is that okay King of the Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I will become
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.32,0:27:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the king of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.74,0:28:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The Battle of the Ritebring Tower outside\Nthe Skull Dome has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.76,0:28:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.88,0:28:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
